        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.115,
            0.201,
            0.743,
            0.239
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Caution",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " — Alcohol should never be placed near a heat source directly, as it is highly flammable and can easily lead to fire and burns."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.145,
            0.276,
            0.628,
            0.313
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Did you wonder why we decolourise the leaf in the beginning of this activity?",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.145,
            0.316,
            0.641,
            0.354
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Decolourisation of a leaf enables us to easily observe colour change and, thus, the presence of starch."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.693,
            0.265,
            0.791,
            0.299
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "D",
